OL,3,GNEWSAPM prepared to reconsider council
OL,4,Achanges in Devon
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has suggested he may
OL,7,Freconsider some aspects of the massive
OL,8,Fchanges to local government that are
OL,9,Fbeing introduced in Devon.
OL,11,FAndy Burnham was responding in
OL,12,Fparliament to a question from
OL,13,FConservative MP for South West Devon,
OL,14,FRebecca Smith, who said constituents
OL,15,Fwere "devastated" by what the changes
OL,16,Fmight mean.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
