OL,3,GNEWSAPM prepared to reconsider council
OL,4,Achanges in Devon
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll of the district, county and unitary
OL,7,Fauthorities in Devon are being
OL,8,Fabolished to make way for four new
OL,9,Funitary authorities based on expansions
OL,10,Fof Plymouth, Exeter and Torbay, and a
OL,11,Fcouncil for the rest of Devon.
OL,13,FSmith has worked with Liberal Democrat
OL,14,FMP for South Devon, Caroline Voaden, on
OL,15,Fpetitions against the proposals which
OL,16,Fhave gathered more than 6,000
OL,17,Fsignatures.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
